<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Page Title</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>This is heading 1</h1>
    <h2>This is heading 2</h2>

    <p>This is a new paragraph.</p>

    <p>This sentence uses <strong>strong importance</strong>.</p>
    <p>This sentence uses both <strong>strong importance</strong> and <em>emphasis</em>.</p>

    <p>This sentence is written in <em>italic</em> style.</p>
    <p>This sentence is written in <small>small</small> style.</p>

    <p>This sentence contains <sub>subscript</sub> and <sup>superscript</sup> text.</p>

    <p>This sentence contains <del>deleted-text</del> and <ins>inserted text</ins>.</p>

    <p>The HTML <a href="https://www.algomau.ca" target="_blank">Algoma University</a> website is linked here.</p>

    <!-- Ensure the image is in the same folder as your HTML file -->
    <img src="milky-way.webp" alt="Description of the image" width="300" height="200">

    <h3>HTML Lists</h3>

    <h4>Ordered List</h4>
    <ol>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ol>

    <h4>Unordered List</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Definition List</h4>
    <dl>
        <dt>HTML</dt>
        <dd>HyperText Markup Language</dd>
        <dt>CSS</dt>
        <dd>Cascading Style Sheets</dd>
        <dt>JavaScript</dt>
        <dd>A programming language for web development</dd>
    </dl>

    <h3>HTML Table</h3>
    <table border="1">
        <tr>
            <th>Header Column 1</th>
            <th>Header Column 2</th>
            <th>Header Column 3</th>
            <th>Header Column 4</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Column 1</td>
            <td>Column 2</td>
            <td>Column 3</td>
            <td>Column 4</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Column 1</td>
            <td>Column 2</td>
            <td>Column 3</td>
            <td>Column 4</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p><a href="#top">Go to Top</a></p>

    <!-- Anchor for "Go to Top" -->
    <div id="top"></div>
</body>
</html>
